 ding all testimony and evidence upon which any appeal may be based (F.S. 2
 86.0105 (http:www.leg.state.fl.usStatutesindex.cfm?App_modeDisplay_Statute
  URL0200-02990286Sections0286.0105.html)). In accordance with the American
 s with Disabilities Act (ADA) and Section 286.26\, Florida Statutes\, pers
 ons with disabilities needing a reasonable accommodation to participate in
